From: yangsong8 <yangsong8@xiaomi.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] nuttx: image_cache: include unistd.h for gettid

lv_nuttx_image_cache.c calls gettid() but only includes nuttx/mm/mm.h,
so it relies on NuttX headers pulling in unistd.h indirectly. Include
unistd.h explicitly so the file keeps building when that indirect
include goes away.

Signed-off-by: yangsong8 <yangsong8@xiaomi.com>
---
diff --git a/src/drivers/nuttx/lv_nuttx_image_cache.c b/src/drivers/nuttx/lv_nuttx_image_cache.c
--- a/src/drivers/nuttx/lv_nuttx_image_cache.c
+++ b/src/drivers/nuttx/lv_nuttx_image_cache.c
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@
 
 #include "../../draw/lv_draw_buf_private.h"
 #include <nuttx/mm/mm.h>
+#include <unistd.h>
 
 /*********************
  *      DEFINES
